[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/AirDrops/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

[b]A staff and debug test, not for normal play.[/b] Dazed Air Drops is planned as supply crates that fall from the sky, either on a random schedule or called in by a player with a rare item. This build only tests the pieces.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td][b]Dazed Core[/b] (subscribe to it too)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Untested[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedAirDropsTest[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[h2]What the test does[/h2]
[list]
[*]Drops a loot crate near you, or far away in an unloaded area.
[*]Plays a plane flyover and a landing thud.
[*]Tries smoke without fire, and marks drops on the map.
[*]Logs the results to console.txt.
[/list]

[h2]Where it is going[/h2]
Drops that are risky trips, not free loot: loud, zombie-drawing, announced on the radio, and shared with other players in multiplayer.

[i]Mod ID: DazedAirDropsTest · Version 0.1.0[/i]
